{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"One table names every route a router app serves."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A route is reached by the path the table names rather than by its own file name."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The names the router fixes are beside the package's manifest."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"The tsconfig naming a fixed name gives that name the package's path mappings."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"The router bundles to the browser whatever a route module exports beyond its loader and its action."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A route module exports its loader and its action alone."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"A request whose method is OPTIONS reaches a route's loader rather than its action."}]}
